%% A1 — Business Architecture (W0 / 8A Architecture Atlas)
%% Audience: business stakeholders. Status tags: [BUILT] implemented, [PLANNED], [BLOCKED] needs an approval/gate first, [LATER] deferred by an owner decision.
%% Revised 2026-10-16 for the first independent review (M-W0-03): prompt authoring is BLOCKED on OD-W0-02.
%% Sources: SRS (Phase 1); 2 §7.4; 4I §4, §6, §9-§12; 6B-6M route owners (AIR §31); 7L §23, §34.5.
flowchart LR
    classDef built fill:#d6f5d6,stroke:#2e7d32,color:#1b5e20
    classDef planned fill:#dbe9ff,stroke:#1e4e9c,color:#0d2b5e
    classDef blocked fill:#ffe0e0,stroke:#c62828,color:#7f0000,stroke-dasharray:5 3
    classDef later fill:#eeeeee,stroke:#757575,color:#424242,stroke-dasharray:2 2

    subgraph S1["1 Sign up and set up"]
        ON["Organization onboarding<br/>owner, users, roles<br/>[PLANNED W1]"]:::planned
        ENT["Plan, subscription and limits<br/>agents, concurrent calls<br/>[PLANNED W2 minimum / W5 full]"]:::planned
        NUM["Business phone number<br/>provisioned by operations,<br/>assigned to an agent<br/>[PLANNED W2]"]:::planned
    end

    subgraph S2["2 Build the AI agent"]
        AG["Agent setup<br/>draft, validate, publish version<br/>[PLANNED W2]"]:::planned
        PR["Voice and language selection<br/>voice, language policy, Tamil first<br/>[PLANNED W2]"]:::planned
        PA["Prompt authoring for the first agent<br/>no V1 prompt route<br/>[BLOCKED: OD-W0-02]"]:::blocked
        KN["Knowledge and tools<br/>documents, RAG, tool calls<br/>[PLANNED W3]"]:::planned
        PV["Preview and deployment<br/>publish = immutable version<br/>[PLANNED W2/W3]"]:::planned
    end

    subgraph S3["3 Talk to customers"]
        IN["Inbound calls<br/>caller dials the business number<br/>[PLANNED W2 = milestone M1]"]:::planned
        SAFE["Call admission safeguards<br/>no accepted provider event lost,<br/>capacity limit, one session per call<br/>[BLOCKED: OD-W0-12 migrations, OD-W0-13 KMS]"]:::blocked
        OUT["Outbound calls and campaigns<br/>lists, pacing, consent, DNC<br/>[PLANNED W4]"]:::planned
        CONV["Customer conversation<br/>Tamil, English, Telugu, Hindi<br/>[PLANNED W2 Tamil / W3 others]"]:::planned
        SIP["SIP trunks<br/>V1 requirement, API not yet designed<br/>[BLOCKED: RR-SIP API reconciliation]"]:::blocked
    end

    subgraph S4["4 Act on results"]
        LQ["Lead qualification and follow-up<br/>CRM, workflows<br/>[PLANNED W4]"]:::planned
        INT["CRM sync and webhooks<br/>[BLOCKED for production: AB-7H-01..08]"]:::blocked
        REC["Call recordings<br/>[BLOCKED: AG-7L-09 - storage stays off]"]:::blocked
    end

    subgraph S5["5 Measure, pay, govern"]
        REP["Reports and analytics<br/>call, lead, campaign, latency<br/>[PLANNED W2 call log / W4-W5 full]"]:::planned
        BILL["Usage metering and invoices<br/>server-calculated, INR first<br/>[BLOCKED for production: AG-7L-02, AG-7L-03]"]:::blocked
        ADM["Enterprise administration<br/>audit, privacy requests, platform admin<br/>[PLANNED W5 / production gated AG-7L-08]"]:::planned
        IE["India Enterprise data residency<br/>[BLOCKED: AB-7I-12]"]:::blocked
    end

    FOUND["Engineering foundation D0<br/>API skeleton, config, DB and Redis, logging<br/>[BUILT]"]:::built
    REG["Class S cross-region recovery<br/>[LATER: optional, OD-7K-02 / OD-7K-05]"]:::later

    FOUND --> ON
    ON --> ENT --> NUM
    ON --> AG
    AG --> PR --> PV
    AG --> PA --> PV
    KN --> PV
    PV --> NUM
    NUM --> SAFE --> IN
    PV --> OUT
    IN --> CONV
    OUT --> CONV
    SIP -.-> IN
    SIP -.-> OUT
    CONV --> LQ
    CONV --> REC
    LQ --> INT
    CONV --> REP
    CONV --> BILL
    ENT --> BILL
    ON --> ADM
    ADM --> IE
    IE -.-> REG
